# Phase 2.2 — Stabilization & Release Readiness

Prepare the `feature/rstudio-usability` branch for a `v2.0.0-beta` release by hardening the R package API, introducing Continuous Integration, and polishing user-facing documentation.

## Proposed Changes

### 1. Structured Return Objects

We will modify the core exported API functions to return comprehensive, structured list objects to support programmatic evaluation downstream, while preserving the existing console logs.

